Who are the Hutts? | Star Wars: Galaxy Guide
Take a deep dive into the Hutt-story behind this crime family’s most infamous members, including Jabba, Rotta, and Gardulla. Learn about the Council’s inner workings and hierarchy, their immunity to Jedi mind tricks, and their mischievous schemes across the Skywalker Saga. This is your complete guide to the Hutt family lore in Star Wars: Galaxy Guide.

